# XMPL100 Driver

<p>A C++20 driver for the XMPL100 analog temperature sensor, read through an ADC channel of any MCU.</p>

[Quickstart](quickstart.md){ .md-button .md-button--primary }
[API guide](api-guide.md){ .md-button }
[Source on GitHub](https://github.com/kokeb-labs/driver-template){ .md-button }
</div>

The driver has no platform code. You give it a small class that reads one ADC channel in millivolts; it does the
rest: power-up timing, range checks, averaging and the transfer function.

