Output
:   500 mV at 0 °C, 10 mV/°C (typical); 100 mV to 1750 mV over -40 °C to +125 °C

Interface
:   One analog output to an MCU ADC channel; optional SHDN_N

Supply
:   Fill in from the datasheet
